# Good-Fortune Unicorn: "put a +1/+1 counter on that creature" means the object that entered (CR 603.6a, 400.7). On turn 3 Bot1's
# Memnite enters and, with the Unicorn's trigger on the stack, Bot1 returns it to hand with Unsummon: the trigger resolves and
# puts no counter on anything (CR 608.2b). Cast again, the Memnite is a new object and its own trigger gives it one counter, not two.

